    "LLUUULLLLLUUUUUUULDLUUUULLLLDLLLLLDDLUUURRRRRUUURUU",
    "UUUUUUUUUURURRRRULLDRRRRRRDDDDDRRRDDDDDRRRRRDDRRULURRRUULLLUUUUUUUULUUULLLLLUUUUUUUULUUUU",
