    "LLUUUUUUUULLLLUUUUULULLLDRRRRULLUUUUUUURULLLLUURURDRURDRRULURRDDRRRDDLLLLLDDDDDDDDDLLLLDDDDDLLLDDDDDDRUUUUURRRRRRRDDDDDRUUUUUUUUUUURRULLLLLLLLUUUULUUUUUUUUUU",
    "UUURRRRRUUUUURRRRRRRRRRRRRRRDDDDLDDLLDDLUULLLLLLUULLLLUUUUULUURRRRRRRRRRRULLLLLLLLLLLURRRRRUUURUU",
    "UUUUUUUUURULLLLUULLLURRRDDDDDDDDDDDRUUUUUUUUUUUULLLLLLLLUUUULUUUUUUUUUU",
    "LLUUULLLLULLUURDRUULURUULDLDDLUUURURRUURRRRRRRRRRDDDDDRUUUUURRRDLLDDDRUURRUURDDDLLDDLLDLLLUUUURULURRRRRDLLLDDRURRRUURDDDLLLDLDDLUULULURULULLLUURRRRRRULUUUUULLLLLLLLLLULUURRRRRUUURUU",
    "LUUUUUUUUUUUUUUUUUUUUUUUULLLLLLLLLLDDRRRRRDDDDDDDDDRRRRRDDDDDRRUUUUURRRRRRUUUUUUUUUURURULLLLLLLLUUUULUUUUUUUUUU",
